# Architecture

```
React → Tauri Command / Channel → PlayerService → LibMpvPlayer → libmpv
```

React 不允许知道 mpv handle、native window handle、FFI pointer、libmpv lifecycle。

必须分离 Domain API 与 libmpv implementation。可简化目录，不可让上层直接依赖 libmpv。

建议模块：

```
src-tauri/src/player/          # service / model / error
src-tauri/src/player/mpv/      # player / events / window
src-tauri/src/acp/             # 按需 Codex ACP
src-tauri/src/notes/           # 本地时间戳笔记
src-tauri/src/commands/player.rs
src-tauri/src/state/app_state.rs
```

`PlayerService`：open / play / pause / stop / seek / get_position / get_duration / set_volume / set_rate / get_state。

预留、本阶段不实现：set_audio_track / set_subtitle_track。

Player Runtime 由 Tauri State 管理。libmpv 不得阻塞 Tauri UI thread。
